        "name": "spect",
        "text": "HOLY SH*T, JENSEN HUANG SAYS GROK BOT USAGE IS SKYROCKETING, AND ELON IS DOING SOMETHING ALMOST NOBODY ELSE DOES\n\nJENSEN HUANG SAYS GROK BOT USAGE IS SKYROCKETING, AND ELON IS DOING SOMETHING ALMOST NOBODY ELSE DOES\n\nnvidia's ceo, spent one minute on elon and grok bot.\n\nwhat he said:\n\n1. elon trains and runs his own models on nvidia chips\n2. grok bot demand is climbing fast, jensen called it super cool\n3. elon also rents that compute out to other companies\n4. building it, running it and renting it: the only other one jensen names is google\n5. his take on elon: nobody knows more about energy\n\nstart small: give grok bot one research task you keep putting off.\n\nsave this and read the article below to make money with grok bot ↓",
