        "text": "i was about to pay for a small Codex subscription just for computer use..\n\nhonestly, I didn't expect Grok bot's computer use to be this fast... I've been more and more impressed with it every day lately.\n\nfor day to day stuff, nothing else I've used comes close right now...great job @bot team..",
