      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-16 06:42:25",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Today's the day 🔥 The Roadster unveil is tonight, and the FAA just locked down the sky over SpaceX's McGregor site from this morning through Oct 31, ground to 5,000 ft within 1.5 nautical miles, with SpaceX as the point of contact.\n\nA 16-day closure tells you tonight's show is only the beginning of what's being tested out there.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "teslayoda",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2000259921309278210/hkktXghC_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-14 22:53:11",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-14T14:53:11.000Z",
        "id": "2110383420664590774",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUmWcjIWoAAxzAL.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "height": 1800,
            "type": "photo",
            "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUmWcjIWoAAxzAL.jpg?name=small",
            "width": 3200
          }
        ],
        "name": "Yoda",
        "text": "The FAA closed the airspace over SpaceX's McGregor site today, ground to 5,000 ft within 1.5 nautical miles, from midnight to 5:04 PM CT, with only aircraft under SpaceX's direction allowed in.\n\nThat's the day before Thursday's Roadster demo. No Oct 15 closure is listed yet, and whether today's TFR is related to the Roadster is still speculation.",
        "url": "https://x.com/teslayoda/status/2110383420664590774",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
