      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "When Konstantin called me way back then, I said I had no idea what it would look like or when it would be made, but he still had the faith to put down a deposit ❤️",
      "quote": {
        "author": "konikaze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/59322024/Corpus_Convert300550001006_snapshot_200x200.JPG",
