    {
      "id": "2110789964430786745",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-15T17:48:38.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-16 01:48:38",
      "type": "引用",
      "type_label": "引用",
      "text": "Old friends are the best friends. Jensen rocks. \n\nThe Star Mind computer being co-engineered by SpaceX and Nvidia is far better than almost anyone expects and will reach volume production next year.\n\nWorking with the incredibly talented Nvidia engineering team is pure joy!",
      "quote": {
        "author": "firesidealpha",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2066254089756061697/MGnZGljz_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-15 21:55:14",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-15T13:55:14.000Z",
        "id": "2110731226776789366",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2110730504534446080/img/WXCc46kIBkkjS28E.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 67.1,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2110730504534446080/img/WXCc46kIBkkjS28E.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2110730504534446080/vid/avc1/1920x1080/Ehc-ubEMWCm9ymOh.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Fireside Alpha",
        "text": "Jensen Huang says he loves working with Elon Musk, and reveals their engineering teams are designing a new type of server to put data centers in space\n\n“I’m delighted that I love working with Elon. He’s using our technology for his own AI in training models and such, deploying models, of course.\"\n\n\"Grok Bot is super cool. The demand for Grok Bot, the consumption for Grok Bot is really skyrocketing. And then, of course, he rents it.\"\n\n\"And so the combination of these three things, he’s fairly unique in doing that. I guess Google does that. That would be yet another example.\"\n\n\"And so I think he also has the advantage that he loves the intersection between computing and the physical buildouts. He loves that whole area. Nobody knows more about energy than he does.\"\n\n\"One particular new market that we’re going to go explore together is putting data centers out in space. Our two engineering teams are working super closely together to create a new type of server, a new type of architecture that might be super good in space and on Earth.”",
        "url": "https://x.com/firesidealpha/status/2110731226776789366",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": null,
      "reply_to": "",
      "engagement": {
        "bookmarks": 636,
        "likes": 13037,
        "quotes": 110,
        "replies": 737,
        "retweets": 1221,
        "views": 854042
      },
      "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2110789964430786745",
      "images": [],
